    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/6a28e3a7b9a11e3fe3106c92891dfcbb.avif?t=1753731967\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Need more information? Want to chat with fellow campers? Come on over and join our Discord channel!</p></p><br><h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/994c288afdd8353aaaf3a8eb672994a0.avif?t=1753731967\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are happy to announce that our Indiegogo backers are now playing an early alpha version of the game.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Gold River Project\u2122 throws you and your friends into an epic, wilderness adventure! Try to escape a grueling experiment across one of the largest private nature reserves in the Pacific Northwest. You are being watched, studied and manipulated at every turn. Scavenge resources, solve the mysteries within and try to survive another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  <strong>CAMP SOLO OR WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Gold River! A remote camping adventure you can do alone or with friends. A chartered float plane will drop you off by beautiful lakes where you can kayak, hike the gorgeous trails, make camp and fall asleep counting the stars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/85ad81c4c47d9bd4c0101851f59c6e7b.poster.avif?t=1753731967\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/85ad81c4c47d9bd4c0101851f59c6e7b.webm?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/85ad81c4c47d9bd4c0101851f59c6e7b.mp4?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TRIP BECOMES A TRAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One week turns into several as you suspect your guide is never coming back. Deserted, you discover you are trapped and now an unwilling lab rat. Can you survive an ever changing, artificial environment and it's inhabitants?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/3c6cf11d0dcdb9ecc590044fbf43bff2.poster.avif?t=1753731967\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/3c6cf11d0dcdb9ecc590044fbf43bff2.webm?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/3c6cf11d0dcdb9ecc590044fbf43bff2.mp4?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WE ARE MOTHER NATURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find a way through increasingly harsh environments, adapt to their unique challenges, and out smart your captors to survival and find a way out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/5edaacc4ad81d9f96879c85b4856519c.poster.avif?t=1753731967\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/5edaacc4ad81d9f96879c85b4856519c.webm?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/5edaacc4ad81d9f96879c85b4856519c.mp4?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Survive by yourself or with friends in online co-op!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crafting:</strong> Build survival equipment, weapons, farm plots and more to help you stay alive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Research:</strong> Learn new things to craft from items you find or from trade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build:</strong> Expand your campsite to prepare for what's to come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scavenge:</strong> All items are all useful, it's up t\ufeffo you to figure it out how.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzles</strong>, <strong>Stealth</strong> or <strong>Discovery:</strong>\u00a0There is more than one way out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress</strong>: Play at your own pace. No time restrictions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replayability:</strong>\u00a0Substations, supplies and points of interest\u00a0 - these locations change with each new play through.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Gold River Project\u2122 throws you and your friends into an epic, wilderness adventure! Try to escape a grueling experiment across one of the largest private nature reserves in the Pacific Northwest. You are being watched, studied and manipulated at every turn. Scavenge resources, solve the mysteries within and try to survive another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  <strong>CAMP SOLO OR WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Gold River! A remote camping adventure you can do alone or with friends. A chartered float plane will drop you off by beautiful lakes where you can kayak, hike the gorgeous trails, make camp and fall asleep counting the stars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/85ad81c4c47d9bd4c0101851f59c6e7b.poster.avif?t=1753731967\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/85ad81c4c47d9bd4c0101851f59c6e7b.webm?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/85ad81c4c47d9bd4c0101851f59c6e7b.mp4?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TRIP BECOMES A TRAP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One week turns into several as you suspect your guide is never coming back. Deserted, you discover you are trapped and now an unwilling lab rat. Can you survive an ever changing, artificial environment and it's inhabitants?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/3c6cf11d0dcdb9ecc590044fbf43bff2.poster.avif?t=1753731967\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/3c6cf11d0dcdb9ecc590044fbf43bff2.webm?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/3c6cf11d0dcdb9ecc590044fbf43bff2.mp4?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WE ARE MOTHER NATURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find a way through increasingly harsh environments, adapt to their unique challenges, and out smart your captors to survival and find a way out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/5edaacc4ad81d9f96879c85b4856519c.poster.avif?t=1753731967\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/5edaacc4ad81d9f96879c85b4856519c.webm?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1253220/extras/5edaacc4ad81d9f96879c85b4856519c.mp4?t=1753731967\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Survive by yourself or with friends in online co-op!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crafting:</strong> Build survival equipment, weapons, farm plots and more to help you stay alive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Research:</strong> Learn new things to craft from items you find or from trade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build:</strong> Expand your campsite to prepare for what's to come.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scavenge:</strong> All items are all useful, it's up t\ufeffo you to figure it out how.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzles</strong>, <strong>Stealth</strong> or <strong>Discovery:</strong>\u00a0There is more than one way out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progress</strong>: Play at your own pace. No time restrictions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replayability:</strong>\u00a0Substations, supplies and points of interest\u00a0 - these locations change with each new play through.</p></li></ul>",
